    "tactics": "",
    "attacksNotes": "<p>Wind Strike [Combat]: Melee attack (Agil 7 + Melee Combat 2), Reach: 10 ft.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Margin 1:</strong>: 10 damage (6 + 4 Str); target pushed 5 feet.</li>\n<li><strong>Margin 2:</strong> 10 damage, DR halved (round up); target pushed 10 feet and knocked Prone; no save.</li>\n<li><strong>Margin 3:</strong> 10 damage, DR halved (round up) + Prone + Stunned until end of their next turn.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Gust Hurl [Combat]: Ranged attack (Dex 4 + Ranged Combat 1), Range: 40 ft.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Margin 1:</strong>: 10 damage (6 + 4 Dex); target makes Fortitude save (1 success) or pushed 5 feet.</li>\n<li><strong>Margin 2:</strong> 10 damage, DR halved (round up); target pushed 10 feet; no save; target knocked Prone.</li>\n</ul>",
    "specialAbilitiesNotes": "<p>Wind Aura: Ranged ### Attacks passing within 10 feet of the Gale Kin add 1 to one die of the attacker's choice from wind interference. Powerful Build: The Gale Kin counts as Huge for carrying, pushing, dragging, and lifting.</p>",
